### E-CYCLE — DESCARTE (solicitar → confirmar) e RELATORIOS
@url = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1) Login CLIENTE
# @name loginCliente
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@email.com", "senha": "senha123" }

### 2) Cliente SOLICITA descarte (status 'solicitado', NAO pontua ainda)
POST {{url}}/entregas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCliente.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_ponto": 1, "id_tipo": 2, "peso_residuo": 10 }

### 3) Cliente ve seus descartes (com status)
GET {{url}}/perfil/entregas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCliente.response.body.token}}

### 4) Login ADMIN DE PONTO (Marcos - Ponto Centro)
# @name loginPonto
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "marcos@email.com", "senha": "ponto123" }

### 5) Admin do ponto ve os pendentes (so do seu ponto)
GET {{url}}/entregas/pendentes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPonto.response.body.token}}

### 6) Admin CONFIRMA (troque o :id pelo id do pendente) -> gera pontos
PUT {{url}}/entregas/6/confirmar
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPonto.response.body.token}}

### 6b) Ou RECUSA
PUT {{url}}/entregas/6/recusar
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPonto.response.body.token}}

### 7) Login ADMIN GLOBAL para relatorios
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "diego@email.com", "senha": "admin123" }

### Relatorios (so contam confirmados)
GET {{url}}/relatorios/ranking
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
